~ neighbour
if Campaign.flag("met_neighbour")
	Neighbour: You again. Good. People come and go so quickly here.
else
	Neighbour: Hello, strangers. Have we met? No... I would remember a face like yours. I think.
	do Campaign.set_flag("met_neighbour")
=> END

~ shopkeeper
Shopkeeper: Open from dawn till the lamps go out. After that you will find me at home, and the shutters down.
=> END

~ townsman
Townsman: By day I am out here. By night I am by my own door. Some of us keep hours.
=> END

~ echo_cyrus
Cyrus: This place again. The dark here sees me back.
=> END

~ echo_enfina
Enfina: I dream of fire and wake up warm. I prefer the other way round.
=> END

~ echo_alithia
Alithia: The futures are loud here. Three lamps. Light them in their order.
=> END

~ echo_prometheus
Prometheus: Everything in a dream is a rehearsal. Light the lamps, and we can practise.
=> END
